  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Fire On My Tongue** (1 other source): Fire On My Tongue is marked as running directly into Don't Let Your Deal Go Down in the uploader's track notes [1]\n- **Roll On Buddy Roll On** (1 other source): Roll On Buddy Roll On is listed as the encore [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **If I Lose**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Fire on the Mountain**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Don't Let the Sunshine Fool You**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **The Wreck of the Edmund Fitzgerald**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Temperance Reel**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-12-29.DAUD** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 154 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-12-29.DAUD**: taped by Flynn; transferred by Flynn; source: (OTS) Schoeps mstc64u > Soyuz LD(sat) > SDMP6ii @ 32 Bit Float [1]. Also: Recorded over the shoulders with Schoeps mstc64u mics, then a Soyuz LD preamp, then an SDMP6ii recorder at 32-bit float [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings UNO Lakefront Arena Nola 24-25 Run Poster Rainbow Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/uno-lakefront-arena-nola-24-25-run-poster-rainbow-foil/) [3]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings UNO Lakefront Arena (NYE Run '24) - New Orleans, LA - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/uno-arena-nye-run-2024-new-orleans-la/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings UNO Lakefront Arena Nola 24-25 Run Poster Rainbow Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/uno-lakefront-arena-nola-24-25-run-poster-rainbow-foil/) [5]",
